{"answerArea":{"calculator":true,"chi2Table":false,"periodicTable":false,"tTable":false,"zTable":false},"hints":[{"content":"The formula for the derivative of $\\arccos(x)$ is:\n\n$\\dfrac{d}{dx}[\\arccos(x)]=\\dfrac{-1}{\\sqrt{1-x^2}}$","images":{},"replace":false,"widgets":{}},{"content":"Let's start by finding $g'(x)$:\n\n$\\begin{align}\ng'(x)\u0026=\\dfrac{d}{dx}\\left[\\arccos\\left(3x\\right)\\right]\n\\\\\\\\\n\u0026=\\dfrac{-1}{\\sqrt{1-\\left(3x\\right)^2}}\\cdot\\dfrac{d}{dx}\\left[3x\\right]\n\\\\\\\\\n\u0026=\\dfrac{-3}{\\sqrt{1-9x^2}}\n\\end{align}$","images":{},"replace":false,"widgets":{}},{"content":"Now we evaluate $g'(x)$ at $\\blueD{x=-\\dfrac{1}{5}}$:\n\n$\\begin{align}\ng'\\left(\\blueD {-\\dfrac{1}{5}}\\right)\u0026=\\dfrac{-3}{\\sqrt{1-9\\left(\\blueD{-\\dfrac{1}{5}}\\right)^2}}\n\\\\\\\\\n\u0026=\\dfrac{-3}{\\sqrt{\\dfrac{16}{25}}}\n\\\\\\\\\n\u0026=-\\dfrac{15}{4}\n\\end{align}$","images":{},"replace":false,"widgets":{}},{"content":"In conclusion, $g'\\left(-\\dfrac{1}{5}\\right)=-\\dfrac{15}{4}$.","images":{},"replace":false,"widgets":{}}],"itemDataVersion":{"major":0,"minor":1},"question":{"content":"$g(x)=\\arccos\\left(3x\\right)$\n\n$g'\\left(-\\dfrac{1}{5}\\right)=$ [[☃ expression 1]]\n\n*Use an exact expression.*","images":{},"widgets":{"expression 1":{"alignment":"default","graded":true,"options":{"answerForms":[{"considered":"correct","form":false,"key":0,"simplify":false,"value":"-\\frac{15}{4}"}],"buttonSets":["basic","prealgebra"],"functions":["f","g","h"],"times":false},"static":false,"type":"expression","version":{"major":1,"minor":0}}}}}
